          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Note that the pair (1, 4) is different from (4, 1). (Why?) So, the number of possible outcomes = 6 × 6 = 36.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.501,
            0.9,
            0.622
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) The outcomes favourable to the event ‘the sum of the two numbers is",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8 ^ { \\circ }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "d",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "enoted "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "by E, are: (2, 6), (3, 5), (4, 4), (5, 3), (6, 2) (see Fig. 14.3)",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " i.e., the number of outcomes favourable to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { E } = 5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hence,",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "P(E) = \\frac{5}{36}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.298,
            0.572,
            0.368,
            0.617
          ],
