            0.901,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) As you can see from Fig. 14.3, there is no outcome favourable to the event F, ‘the sum of two numbers is 13’.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 0 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, P(F) =",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 0 "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "36",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.746,
            0.9,
            0.787
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) As you can see from Fig. 14.3, all the outcomes are favourable to the event "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { G }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "‘sum of two numbers",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\leq 1 2 ^ { \\star }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
